                "title": "Diamond Crystal Knob",
                "description": "The Diamond Crystal Knob is beautiful on its own, but when paired with one of the rosettes below, it makes for one wonderful knobset. This Clear Crystal Diamond Knob is available in a wide array of finishes, so you can truly customize your door knob to accentuate your home. The Diamond Crystal Knob  will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. This Ornate Clear Crystal Diamond Knob is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
